{
  "name": "projection-claims",
  "description": "A created Belief's first .md alias claims its projection path, and the claim must be one the projection writer can create: an escaping claim, a bare .md leaf, a '.' segment and an absolute path are each refused with no effect; concepts/acme.md is then claimed, and a second .md alias after the claim is a hint that claims nothing. A NUL, a control character, a leaf over 243 bytes (ASCII or CJK) and a folder name over 255 bytes are refused, and so are a claim inside another claim's file, one another claim sits inside, and a set whose members nest; a shared string prefix, a 243-byte leaf and a 255-byte folder name are claimed.",
